{title: I Must Tell Jesus}
{artist: Elisha Hoffman}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 76}

Verse 1
[G]I must tell Jesus [C]all of my [G]trials, I cannot bear these [A]burdens a[D]lone;
[G]in my distress he [C]kindly will [G]help me — he ever loves and [D]cares for his [G]own.

Chorus
[G]I must tell Jesus! [C]I must tell [G]Jesus! I cannot bear my [A]burdens a[D]lone;
[G]I must tell Jesus! [C]I must tell [G]Jesus! Jesus can help me, [D]Jesus a[G]lone.
